cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i9N9V7LCvE0Q7kNvwG0sm8L&_nc_oc=AdrgMwc3AQEx6Y_M64YR2AXvQ9Z51nn77h8awf36kCcQb8JZ8xQdcOpva-O6JCj_fdk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXEKmtDzmL1guxFLnirmEVJ1MUjFX3G-N8E6E90h-oQJQ&oe=6B105F83"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "We Are Tanks", "keywords": ["tanks", "arcade", "synthwave", "retro", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "Welcome to We Are Tanks \u2014 a fast-paced, arcade-style multiplayer VR game where you become a sleek, neon-lit battle tank and fight for one thing: kills.\n\nNo time limits. No complicated rules. Just hop in, blast other players, and climb the scoreboard. It's raw, retro-fueled action in a glowing synthwave arena where every hit matters and style is everything.\n\n\ud83c\udfae Features:\n\n\ud83c\udfaf Kill-based multiplayer mayhem \u2014 rack up the most takedowns\n\n\ud83c\udf0c Retro synthwave aesthetic with glowing grids and thumping beats\n\n\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Minimalist, low-poly tank design \u2014 smooth and stylish\n\n\ud83d\udc51 Score is king. Outgun your friends and own the arena\n\nNo clock. No breaks. Just you, your tank, and the never-ending hunt for that next explosive hit.\n\nWe Are Tanks. Are you the deadliest?", "short_description": "Simple tanks. Synthwave vibes. Pure multiplayer chaos.\n\nSuit up and roll out in We Are Tanks \u2014 a fast, arcade-style VR multiplayer brawler where you and your friends become sleek retro battle tanks in a neon-lit arena. No tutorials, no fluff \u2014 just raw, synth-soaked mayhem."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.fonolabs.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/WAT_PrivacyPolicy.txt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "FonoLabs", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.fono-labs.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_categ